<section id="contacto" class="contact-section">
  <div class="section-bar">
    <h2>Correspondencia &amp; Consultoría</h2>
    <span class="folio-num">[ Folio 08 &ndash; Colofón ]</span>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-card">
    <div class="contact-stamp-header">
      <span class="stamp-pill">§ REGISTRO TÉCNICO DIRECTO</span>
      <span class="stamp-edition">DISPONIBILIDAD ACTIVA</span>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-body">
      <h3 class="contact-title">¿Tienes un proyecto, desafío técnico o sistema que poner en marcha?</h3>
      <p class="contact-text">
        Disponible para diseño e ingeniería de software: plataformas de comercio electrónico, arquitecturas reactivas con Astro y Django, módulos de cartografía en tiempo real o instrumentación de campo y telemetría IoT. Trabajo en modalidad remota y en terreno en la zona sur de Chile.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-interactive-panel">
        <div class="email-display-box">
          <span class="email-label">CORREO ELECTRÓNICO:</span>
          <span class="email-address">felipegp90@gmail.com</span>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-actions-cluster">
          <button class="contact-btn btn-highlight" data-copy-email="felipegp90@gmail.com" type="button">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
            Copiar al Portapapeles
          </button>

          <a href="mailto:felipegp90@gmail.com" class="contact-btn">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z"/><path d="M22 2 11 13"/></svg>
            Abrir Cliente de Correo &rarr;
          </a>

          <a href="https://github.com/felipooon" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-btn">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
            Perfil GitHub &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-footer-metadata">
      <span>Coordenadas: Puerto Montt, Región de Los Lagos, CL &bull; 41°28′ S, 72°56′ O</span>
      <span>Huso Horario: GMT-3 / America/Santiago</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-section {
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 2px solid var(--border-dark);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--shadow-color);
    position: relative;
  }

  .contact-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .contact-stamp-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .stamp-pill {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .stamp-edition {
    color: #22c55e;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .contact-text {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .contact-interactive-panel {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .email-display-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .email-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .email-address {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .contact-actions-cluster {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-btn:hover {
    background: var(--surface-matte);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--shadow-color);
  }

  .btn-highlight {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .btn-highlight:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .contact-footer-metadata {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-card { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .contact-title { font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .contact-actions-cluster { flex-direction: column; }
    .contact-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .contact-footer-metadata { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
